WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:03.163
- I'm here with Louanna
who is a mom of three.

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:07.070
We've been talking about
her female support group,

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:09.920
we're talking about
divorce, divorce with kids,

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:14.410
and I actually was able to
bring in two fantastic women

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:17.180
to add to her support group.

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:20.500
Please meet money
expert, Carmen Rita Wong,

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.841
and relationship therapist,
Dr. Argie Allen Wilson.

00:00:23.841 --> 00:00:25.523
(audience applauding)
Hi, guys.

00:00:25.523 --> 00:00:27.421
- Hi. Hi, Drew.
- Hi.

00:00:27.421 --> 00:00:28.930
- Hello.

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:32.700
- Carmen, in this support
group that we're building

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.690
in addition to Louanna's already existing

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:38.180
support group of female friends,

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.440
you are also a divorced single mother?

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.500
- Yes, ma'am, I am.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.060
- Can I ask your advice?

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.250
In your specialty of finance,

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.680
do you have any advice for Louanna

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.070
while she is navigating this divorce?

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.600
- One of the most
important things you can do

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.320
when you go to the table to
finalize things financially

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.290
is keeping those kids in mind.

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:01.300
One of the best pieces
of advice that I got

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:02.630
when I was going through my divorce

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:04.377
was my attorney saying to me,

00:01:04.377 --> 00:01:07.580
"You have more power than you know."

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:09.090
And that's at the financial table.

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:12.810
If you keep those kids in mind,
if they're your North Star,

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.730
then you can get some stability
and security in your life.

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:18.570
Whether it's their
education, health insurance,

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:21.470
whatever it is, always have them in mind

00:01:21.470 --> 00:01:24.600
so you're coming at the
table with great energy,

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:27.600
positive energy, love for them,

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.810
but you're a little bit of a mama bear,

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:30.680
you know what I mean?

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:33.260
- Dr. Argie, is there any way

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:35.490
to emotionally prepare yourself

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:37.130
for signing divorce papers?

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.727
And this question comes with,

00:01:38.727 --> 00:01:41.774
"God, I wish I had been able
to ask you that myself."

00:01:41.774 --> 00:01:44.760
- (laughs) Well, thank
you for having me, Drew.

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.340
And Louanna, I have to say

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:49.810
that you are such an amazing inspiration.

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:53.560
It's true that divorce
is kinda like a death.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:54.810
Think of divorce like a death,

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:57.420
but the truth is that it's the death

00:01:57.420 --> 00:02:00.310
of the lifelong relationship
that we dreamed of.

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:04.180
So focus on radical self-care and action.

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:06.370
We can turn that pain into power, Louanna,

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.030
but in order to turn it into power,

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:10.200
we have to appreciate the process

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:12.620
so we can walk in our purpose.

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:14.010
That's the goal.

00:02:14.010 --> 00:02:16.490
- Can I ask you a question, Louanna?

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:20.930
Do you have any ability to
have someone watch your kids

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:23.770
for the day that you
sign your divorce papers?

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:26.520
'Cause, looking back, I wish
I had done that for myself.

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:29.483
Faking it for them was
hell. I'm not gonna lie.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:32.510
And if I had just had a window of a day

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:34.570
to process and be around friends

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:38.120
and just not have to put on that front...

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:39.820
It was very difficult.

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:41.510
- No, now that you mention it,

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.220
maybe I will get a babysitter.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:46.130
Maybe I will go out to a lunch or a dinner

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:49.000
with my girlfriends or
make it just about me

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:52.300
and just do whatever I would love to do.

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:53.560
But that's an amazing idea.

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:55.350
I didn't even know that I...

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:57.150
I couldn't even think of that myself.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.543
- We actually have a little
surprise for you, Louanna.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:04.600
There were a few things that
some of your very best friends

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:06.420
wanted to tell you.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.253
- Hi, Louanna.

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:09.610
I just wanted to let you
know how much I love you.

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:11.190
- I love you.
(inspiring music)

00:03:11.190 --> 00:03:12.900
- You were there for me from everything

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:16.740
through the death of my mother,
Tim being deployed to Iraq.

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:18.170
- I admire your strength and tenacity \

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:19.340
over the last couple of years.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.410
- I've seen you overcome
so many obstacles in life.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:25.270
You've taught me that no
matter how hard life gets,

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:28.460
you can always bounce back and
better than you were before.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:30.270
- You've risen above all the things

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:31.470
that you've been through.

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:34.370
- You really are one of the bravest

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:38.000
and most inspiring women
that I have ever met.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.000
The last few years have not been easy.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.780
There have been plenty of challenges.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.670
The road is bumpy as hell.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:46.602
- And know that I'm there for
you, no matter what, always.

00:03:46.602 --> 00:03:47.800
- Don't ever change who you are.

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.540
And I'm always here for you.

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:53.810
- I am here to support you
in anything and everything.

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:56.973
I'm not going anywhere.
Bad girls for life.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.279
I love you.

00:03:59.279 --> 00:04:00.112
(music fades)
(audience applauding)

00:04:00.112 --> 00:04:02.540
- Oh, my gosh. That was amazing.

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:03.610
Thank you so much.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.210
I love it. Thanks so much.
- That group of girlfriends,

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:07.700
that is who you need to be with

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:09.430
on the day you sign those papers.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.380
Get a babysitter.

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:15.370
If I could have a
get-in-the-DeLorean-and-do-it-differently,

00:04:15.370 --> 00:04:18.833
I would not be in front
of my kids that day.

00:04:19.669 --> 00:04:22.530
- Aw. No, thank you for
that recommendation.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.560
I totally will plan it that way.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:27.840
- I wanna thank Louanna
with all of my heart

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.680
for having what is a very
difficult discussion.

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:34.470
But trying to figure out how
to navigate it is everything.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:37.390
And I really wanna thank
Dr. Argie and Carmen

00:04:37.390 --> 00:04:40.410
for coming in and getting
into that support group

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:42.720
and sharing your wisdom and experience.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:43.932
Thank you guys so much.

00:04:43.932 --> 00:04:46.515
(upbeat music)

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.539
♪ Oh ♪

00:04:50.539 --> 00:04:52.289
♪ Oh ♪

